{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ad2946f5a1cb9e4b","name":"Sullustan","source":{"id":"source:reference-ad2946f5a1cb9e4b","title":"Sullustan","revision":27360,"timestamp":"2025-10-13T11:31:04Z","sha256":"fcc38d625ae20288cab944ae8617b36c42b3477c266f49b3ae3f288855ca5e2b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=27360","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sullustan&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ad2946f5a1cb9e4b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["To survive the natural perils of their harsh, volcanic homeworld, the Sullustans evolved in the planet's numerous caves. They prefer to dwell underground, constructing highly advanced cities of such great beauty that wealthy sightseers come from all over the galaxy to visit them. Living underground helped the Sullustans to develop acute senses, and they are renowned for their navigational and piloting skills.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This friendly, gregarious species enjoys interacting with unique, unusual, and interesting beings. When Old Republic scouts first visited their homeworld, the Sullustans quickly embraced galactic civilization. The Sullustan manufacturing company SoroSuub is one of the largest non-",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"},"-owned interstellar corporations in the galaxy. In fact, the company was so powerful that it has become the official government of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sullust"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sullust","referenceId":"reference:0acf0480bb01d4e6"},", and more than half the planet's population is on its payroll.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Sullustan Characteristics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Personality:"]}," Sullustans tend to be pragmatic, pleasant, and fond of practical jokes.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Physical Description:"]}," Sullustans are humanoid with large eyes, big ears, and jowls. The average Sullustan stands 1.5 meters tall and weighs 55 kilograms.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Age Groups"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Age_Groups"},":"]}," Sullustans age at the following stages:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHILD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["YOUNG ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MIDDLE AGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["OLD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["VENERABLE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1-9 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10-14 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["15-39 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["40-55 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["56-69 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["70+ Years\n"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Homeworld:"]}," The volcanic, technological world of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sullust"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sullust","referenceId":"reference:0acf0480bb01d4e6"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Sullustans speak, read, and write Sullustese and Basic.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Example Names:"]}," Aril Nunb, Dllr Nep, Nien Nunb, Sian Tevv, Syub Snunb.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Adventurers:"]}," Sullustan adventurers enjoy exploring the galaxy as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scouts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scouts"},", conducting business as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nobles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nobles"},", and pulling pranks as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrels"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrels"}," to see how others react. They are inquisitive and love to discover things through personal experience, sometimes being a bit reckless.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Sullustan Species Traits"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Sullustans share the following Species Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," Sullustans receive a +2 bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"},", but suffer a -2 penalty to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"},". Sullustans are quick, agile, and good with ranged weapons, but they are not as hardy as other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Medium Size:"]}," As Medium creatures, Sullustans have no special bonuses or penalties due to their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Sullustans have a base speed of 6 squares."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Darkvision:"]}," Sullustans ignore ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," (including ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Concealment"},") from darkness. However, they cannot perceive colors in total darkness."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Expert Climber:"]}," Sullustans are adept at climbing in their underground homes. A Sullustan may choose to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Climb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Climb","referenceId":"reference:98ca5f27d9642dc7"}," checks even when distracted or threatened."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Heightened Awareness:"]}," A Sullustan may choose to reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check, but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Sullustans can speak, read, and write both Basic and Sullustese."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Sullustan Species Feats"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Sullustan characters have access to the following ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species_Feats"},". No Species Feats are considered Bonus Feats for any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Class"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SPECIES FEAT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["BENEFITS\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Darkness Dweller"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darkness_Dweller","referenceId":"reference:c746c114409d8ab0"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Impose a penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks made when close to you.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Disarming Charm"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disarming_Charm","referenceId":"reference:c5eaafe34a65fc07"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Gain a bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," on targets whose ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attitude"}," you have improved.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sure Climber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sure_Climber","referenceId":"reference:5497fe9373e6adc6"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Gain a Climb Speed of 4 squares.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
